; Edge recorder for the protocol detective (sw/pemu/detect.py): the time of every edge on one
; pin, on the chip's shared 32-bit cycle counter. Falling and rising edges alternate, starting
; with a falling one. Written after the RTL froze.
; Config: IN_BASE = the pin. Host: read words from RXF (the LED board's bridge buffers 1024).
.program edge_capture
.wrap_target
    wait 0, pin, 0
    in time, 32
    push
    wait 1, pin, 0
    in time, 32
    push
.wrap
